{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.LiftedCrossingLocality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.LiftedCrossingLocality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.List.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.canonical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.canonical","kind":"instance","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L57-L72","doc":"**Trivial-link skeleton instance.**  Models every link\nconfiguration as having no crossings (`crossings k := []`),\nmultiplicative-neutral local factor (`localFactor := 1`), and\nzero base mass (`massGB := 0`).  Under this honest \"trivial\nlink\" reading, `massGBSubset k S = 0 = 0 · ∏(map 1 _) = massGB k\n· (S.map localFactor).prod`, so factorisation closes by `simp`.\nEncodes none of the KZ-flatness / Kohno–Drinfeld content but\nuses the canonical multiplicative-identity local factor rather\nthan `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.productFormCollapse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.productFormCollapse","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L48-L55","doc":"Product-form collapse of the crossing-graded expansion under\nlocality: if the locality factor η(c) is homogeneous (η ≡ 1),\nthe expansion collapses to (1 + ξ)^c. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.factorization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.factorization","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.localFactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.localFactor","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.massGBSubset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.massGBSubset","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.massGB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.massGB","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.crossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.crossings","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality.mk","kind":"ctor","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LiftedCrossingLocality","kind":"class","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.lean#L29-L43","doc":"**Lifted-crossing locality** (conjectural class).\nAsserts that the GB mass of a subset of lifted crossings\nfactorizes through a single-crossing local factor η. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:lifted-crossing-locality","label":"conj:lifted-crossing-locality","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lifted-crossing-locality.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}